# THIS REPO'S OWN receipts, not the payload copy next door in
# core/.agents/receipts/.gitignore.
#
# WHY THERE ARE TWO. Git does not follow a symlinked .gitignore -- verified,
# not assumed: a symlink here is staged as an ordinary file and its patterns
# are never applied, so every ephemeral receipt would be committed. A pointer
# is therefore impossible and a real file is the only option.
#
# WHAT KEEPS THEM HONEST. scripts/check-root-wiring.mjs compares the pattern
# lines below against the payload copy and fails when they diverge. That is
# what makes this a mirror rather than a fork -- the duplication is enforced,
# not merely intended. Edit the payload copy; this one follows.
#
# The reasoning for the patterns themselves -- why evidence is ignored and
# decisions are committed, and why a directory exclusion plus negations cannot
# work -- lives in core/.agents/receipts/.gitignore and README.md.
pr-*.json
loop-round-check-*.json
loop-round-check-*.claim
